AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002903 "The Soldier River Barb is a native Thailand freshwater species which is distributed throughout South East Asia in Cambodia, Vietnam, Indonesia, Laos,Malaysia and Thailand where it is found throughout the Mekong basin and surrounding areas."@en)
