AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_00002905 obo:IAO_0000122)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002905 "Sillago is a genus of fish in the family Sillaginidae and the only non-monotypic genus in the family. Distinguishing the species can be difficult, with many similar in appearance and colour, forcing the use of swim bladder morphology as a definitive feature."@en)
