# Class: obo:FOODON_00003009 (kabocha squash plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_00003009 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00003009 "Kabocha is a type of winter squash, a Japanese variety of the species Cucurbita maxima. It is also called kabocha squash or Japanese pumpkin in North America. In Japan, \"kabocha\" may refer to either this squash, to the Western pumpkin, or indeed to other squashes."@en)
