AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00003281 "A fisheries term for several species of demersal fish with fins, particularly Atlantic cod (Gadus morhua), whiting (Merluccius bilinearis), haddock (Melanogrammus aeglefinus), hake (Urophycis), pollock (Pollachius), and others."@en)
