# Class: obo:FOODON_03411008 (mesogastropod)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03411008 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411008 "Mesogastropoda was for many years a traditional taxonomic group of snails, an order. The order was composed mostly of sea snails, but it also included some land snails and freshwater snails, all of which were prosobranch gastropod mollusks.  [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mesogastropoda]"@en)
