# Class: obo:FOODON_03411155 (sea catfish family)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03411155 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411155 "The *Ariidae* or ariid catfish are a family of catfish that mainly live in marine waters with many freshwater and brackish water species. They are found worldwide in tropical to warm temperate zones. The family includes about 143 species. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ariidae]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03411155 <http://eol.org/pages/5115>)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03411155 langual:B1155)
