# Class: obo:FOODON_03411253 (goose)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000600 obo:FOODON_03411253 "Geese are waterfowl belonging to the tribe Anserini of the family *Anatidae*. This tribe comprises the genera *Anser* (the grey geese), *Branta* (the black geese) and *Chen* (the white geese). Some other birds, mostly related to the shelducks, have \"goose\" as part of their names. More distantly related members of the family *Anatidae* are swans, most of which are larger than true geese, and ducks, which are smaller.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goose]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03411253 "anser spp."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03411253 "branta spp."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03411253 "chen spp."@en)

