# Class: obo:FOODON_03411281 (kale plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03411281 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411281 "Kale (also called Borecole) is a form of cabbage (*Brassica oleracea* Acephala Group) in which the central leaves do not form a head. It is considered to be closer to wild cabbage than most domesticated forms. The species *Brassica oleracea* contains a wide array of vegetables, including broccoli, cauliflower, and Brussels sprouts. The Cultivar Group Acephala also includes spring greens and collard greens, which are extremely similar genetically. Kale can be classified by leaf type: Curly leaved (Scots kales), Plain leaved, Rape kale, Leaf and spear (a cross between curly leaved and plain leaved kale), Cavolo nero (also known as black cabbage, Tuscan kale, Lacinato and dinosaur kale)"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:FOODON_03411281 "WIKIPEDIA:Kale)")
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03411281 <http://eol.org/pages/583899>)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03411281 obo:NCBITaxon_3712)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03411281 <http://www.ars-grin.gov/cgi-bin/npgs/html/taxon.pl?319629>)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03411281 <http://www.itis.gov/servlet/SingleRpt/SingleRpt?search_topic=TSN&search_value=23062>)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03411281 langual:B1281)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03411281 "MANSFELD:23870")
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasNarrowSynonym obo:FOODON_03411281 "Brassica oleracea L.")
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasNarrowSynonym obo:FOODON_03411281 "Brassica oleracea L. var. sabellica L.")
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasNarrowSynonym obo:FOODON_03411281 "Brassica oleracea var. sabellica L.")
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03411281 "brassica oleracea"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03411281 "cole"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03411281 "kale plant"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03411281 obo:FOODON_03411566)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03411281 obo:FOODON_03413372)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03411283 (melon plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03411283 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411283 "Melon is a name given to various members of the plant family *Cucurbitaceae* with sweet flavored, fleshy fruit e.g. gourds or cucurbits. Melon can be referred as a plant or a fruit. Many different cultivars have been produced, particularly of muskmelons."@en)
