# Class: obo:FOODON_03411322 (rice plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03411322 obo:IAO_0000122)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411322 "Oryza sativa, commonly known as Asian rice, is the plant species most commonly referred to in English as rice.  *Oryza sativa* contains two major subspecies: the sticky, short-grained *japonica* or *sinica* variety, and the nonsticky, long-grained *indica* variety."@en)
