# Class: obo:FOODON_03411433 (shellfish species)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03411433 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411433 "The term shellfish is used both broadly and specifically. For regulatory purposes it is often narrowly defined as filter-feeding molluscs such as clams, mussels, and oyster to the exclusion of crustaceans and all else. Although their shells may differ, all shellfish are invertebrates."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:FOODON_03411433 wikipedia:Shellfish)
