# Class: obo:FOODON_03411439 (plantain (musa) plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411439 "Plantain is the common name for herbaceous plants of the genus *Musa*. The fruit they produce is generally used for cooking, in contrast to the soft, sweet banana (which is sometimes referred to as the dessert banana). There is a formal botanical distinction between bananas and plantains based on its structure and genus/species."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:FOODON_03411439 wikipedia:Cooking_banana)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03411439 langual:B1439)
