AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411473 "The tangelo, *Citrus* × tangelo, is also widely known as the honeybell. Tangelo is a citrus fruit that is a hybrid of a tangerine and either a pomelo or a grapefruit."@en)
