# Class: obo:FOODON_03411535 (agave plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03411535 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411535 "Agave is a genus of monocots native to the hot and arid regions of Mexico and the Southwestern United States. Some agave species are also native to tropical areas of South America. Some species are known by the name \"century plant\". Agave tequilana, agave azul or blue agave, is used in the production of tequila. Agave nectar, also called agave syrup, a sweetener derived from Agave sap, is used as an alternative to sugar in cooking, and can be added to breakfast cereals as a binding agent."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03411535 langual:B1535)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03411535 "agave plant"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03411535 obo:FOODON_03411048)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03411538 (shallot plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03411538 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411538 "The shallot is a type of onion, specifically a botanical variety of the species *Allium cepa*. The shallot was formerly classified as a separate species,* A. ascalonicum*, a name now considered a synonym of the currently accepted name. 
 Like garlic, shallots are formed in clusters of offsets with a head composed of multiple cloves. The skin colour of shallots can vary from golden brown to gray to rose red, and their off-white flesh is usually tinged with green or magenta. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shallot]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03411538 <http://eol.org/pages/8187>)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03411538 obo:NCBITaxon_4679)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03411538 <http://www.ars-grin.gov/cgi-bin/npgs/html/taxon.pl?101652>)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03411538 <http://www.itis.gov/servlet/SingleRpt/SingleRpt?search_topic=TSN&search_value=42720>)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03411538 langual:B1538)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03411538 "MANSFELD:110")
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasNarrowSynonym obo:FOODON_03411538 "Allium cepa L.")
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasNarrowSynonym obo:FOODON_03411538 "Allium cepa L. var. aggregatum G. Don")
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasNarrowSynonym obo:FOODON_03411538 "Allium cepa L. var. aggregatum G.Don")
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03411538 "allium cepa var. aggregatum"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03411538 "shallot plant"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03411538 obo:FOODON_03411058)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03411538 obo:FOODON_03411300)
