# Class: obo:FOODON_03411568 (apple banana plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03411568 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411568 "Latundan bananas (also called Tundan, Silk bananas, Pisang raja sereh, Manzana bananas or Apple bananas), are triploid hybrid banana cultivars from the Philippines. It is one of the most common banana cultivars in the Philippines, along with the Lacatan and Saba bananas."@en)
