AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411663 "Horse bean and field bean refer to *Vigna faba* L. cultivars with smaller, harder seeds (more like the wild species) used for animal feed, though their stronger flavour is preferred in some human food recipes, such as falafel."@en)
