AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03411713 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03411713 "A mature female chicken (usually more than 10 months of age) with meat less tender than that of a roaster, and with a nonflexible breastbone tip."@en)
