# Class: obo:FOODON_03412016 (tree tomato plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03412016 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03412016 "Solanum betaceum (syn. *Cyphomandra betacea*) is a small tree or shrub in the flowering plant family Solanaceae \"the nightshade plant\". It is best known as the species that bears the tamarillo, an egg-shaped edible fruit. Other names include tree tomato, tomate de árbol, and dutch eggplant in Indonesia."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:FOODON_03412016 "WIKIPEDIA:Cyphomandra_betacea")
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412016 <http://eol.org/pages/4437>)
