AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03412051 "Tilia  is a genus of about 30 species of trees native or bushes throughout most of the temperate Northern Hemisphere. Commonly called lime trees or \"'lime bushes'\" in the British Isles, they are not closely related to the lime fruit. Other names include linden, and basswood for the North American species. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tilia]"@en)
