# Class: obo:FOODON_03412405 (goosefish family)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03412405 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03412405 "Anglerfishes are fish of the teleost order Lophiiformes. They are bony fish named for their characteristic mode of predation, in which a fleshy growth from the fish's head (the esca or illicium) acts as a lure. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anglerfish]"@en)
