# Class: obo:FOODON_03412801 (fadogiella plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03412801 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03412801 "Fadogiella is a genus of flowering plants in the *Rubiaceae* family. It was descripted by Walter Robyns in 1928. This genus is morphologically similar to *Fadogia* and is related to the latter genus. It is found in central and east tropical Africa."@en)
