# Class: obo:FOODON_03412804 (grewia plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03412804 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03412804 "The large flowering plant genus *Grewia* is today placed by most authors in the mallow family *Malvaceae*, in the expanded sense as proposed by in the APG. Several species, namely phalsa, are known for their edible fruit, which are of local commercial importance. The astringent and refreshing *Grewia* drupes are particularly popular in summertime. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grewia]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412804 <http://eol.org/pages/4321>)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412804 langual:B2804)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03412804 "grewia spp."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03412804 "grewia plant"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03412804 obo:FOODON_03411024)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03412804 obo:FOODON_03414282)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03412805 (guarea plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03412805 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03412805 "Guarea is a genus of evergreen trees in the mahogany family *Meliaceae*, native to tropical Africa and Central and South America. They are large trees 20-45 m tall, with a trunk over 1 m trunk diameter, often buttressed at the base. The leaves are pinnate, with 4-6 pairs of leaflets, the terminal leaflet present. The flowers are produced in loose inflorescences, each flower small, with 4-5 yellowish petals. The fruit is a four or five-valved capsule, containing several seeds, each surrounded by a yellow-orange fleshy aril; the seeds are dispersed by hornbills and monkeys which eat the fleshy aril."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:FOODON_03412805 "WIKIPEDIA:Guarea")
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412805 <http://eol.org/pages/4413>)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412805 <http://www.ars-grin.gov/cgi-bin/npgs/html/taxon.pl?459726>)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412805 langual:B2805)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412805 "PLANTS:GUARE")
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasNarrowSynonym obo:FOODON_03412805 "Guarea Allam. ex L.")
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasNarrowSynonym obo:FOODON_03412805 "Guarea sp.")
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03412805 "guarea spp."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03412805 "guarea plant"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03412805 obo:FOODON_03411024)

