# Class: obo:FOODON_03412941 (curled endive plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03412941 "Curly endive, or frisée (var *crispum*). This type has narrow, green, curly outer leaves. It is sometimes called chicory in the United States and is called chicorée frisée in French."@en)
