# Class: obo:FOODON_03412969 (common cranberry plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03412969 obo:IAO_0000122)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03412969 "Vaccinium oxycoccos is a species of flowering plant in the heath family. It is known by the common names small cranberry, bog cranberry, swamp cranberry, or, particularly in Britain, just cranberry. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vaccinium_oxycoccos]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03412969 <http://eol.org/pages/484408>)
