AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03413808 "Esociformes are a small order of ray-finned fish, with two families, the *Umbridae* (mudminnows) and the *Esocidae* (pikes). The pikes of genus *Esox* give the order its name."@en)
