AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03413809 "The Osmeriformes comprise an order of ray-finned fish that includes the true or freshwater smelts and allies, such as the galaxiids and noodlefishes; they are also collectively called osmeriforms. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Osmeriformes]"@en)
