AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414302 "Allium is a genus of monocotyledonous flowering plants that includes hundreds of species, including the cultivated onion, garlic, scallion, shallot, leek, and chives. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Allium]"@en)
