AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414351 "Aleurites moluccana, the Candlenut, is a flowering tree in the spurge family, *Euphorbiaceae*, also known as Candleberry, Indian walnut, Kemiri, Varnish tree, Nuez de la India, Buah keras or Kukui nut tree."@en)
