# Class: obo:FOODON_03414353 (cleopatra orange plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414353 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414353 "This species is the chota or billi kichili of India and the Cleopatra mandarin of the United States.  The tree is attractive, round-topped, symmetrical, and thornless, with small, dark-green leaves.  The fruit is orange-red, small, oblate, and highly depressed at the apex, with thin, somewhat rough rind.  The flesh texture is soft and juicy and the flavor is somewhat acid.  Seeds are small, polyembryonic, and have green cotyledons.
 
Considered to be native to India and said to have been introduced into Florida from Jamaica sometime prior to 1888, *Citrus reshni* is increasingly important as a rootstock in the United States and elsewhere.  It is an attractive ornamental and bears fruit the year round. [http://websites.lib.ucr.edu/agnic/webber/Vol1/Chapter4.html]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03414353 <http://eol.org/pages/4414>)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03414353 <http://www.ars-grin.gov/cgi-bin/npgs/html/taxon.pl?314357>)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03414353 langual:B4353)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasNarrowSynonym obo:FOODON_03414353 "Citrus reshni hort. ex Tanaka")
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03414353 "citrus reshni"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03414353 "spice mandarin"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03414353 "cleopatra orange plant"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03414353 obo:FOODON_03411429)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03414354 (orangelo plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414354 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414354 "An orangelo (Spanish chironja) is a hybrid citrus fruit believed to have originated in Puerto Rico. The fruit, a cross between a grapefruit and an orange, had spontaneously appeared in the shade-providing trees grown on coffee plantations in the Puerto Rican highlands."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:FOODON_03414354 "WIKIPEDIA:Orangelo")
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03414354 langual:B4354)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03414354 "chironja"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03414354 "orangelo plant"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03414354 obo:FOODON_03411139)

