AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414514 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414514 "Choy sum or choi sum also known as the Chinese Flowering Cabbage, literally means vegetable heart in Cantonese if directly translated. Chinese Flowering Cabbage (*Brassica rapa* var. *parachinensis* or *Brassica chinensis* var. *parachinensis*) is a member of the *Brassica* genus and the *Brassicaceae* (mustard) family."@en)
