AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414542 "A species of mushroom closely related to Craterellus tubaeformis. Its hymenium is usually orange or white, whereas the hymenium of C. tubaeformis is grey. C. lutescens is also usually found in wetlands."@en)
