# Class: obo:FOODON_03414603 (peruvian calico scallop)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414603 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414603 "Argopecten purpuratus, common name the \"Peruvian scallop\", is an edible species of saltwater clam, a scallop, a marine bivalve mollusk in the family *Pectinidae*, the scallops. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Argopecten_purpuratus]"@en)
