AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414616 "The Australian bustard (*Ardeotis australis*) is a large ground bird of grassland, woodland and open agricultural country across northern Australia and southern New Guinea. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Australian_bustard]"@en)
