# Class: obo:FOODON_03414619 (monitor lizard)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414619 obo:IAO_0000122)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414619 "The common name of several large lizard species, comprising the genus *Varanus*. They are native to Africa, Asia and Oceania, but are now found also in the Americas as an invasive species. A total of 79 species are currently recognized."@en)
