AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414627 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414627 "A family of freshwater crayfish found in the southern hemisphere. The family is a classic Gondwana-distributed taxon, with extant members in South America, Madagascar, Australia, New Zealand and New Guinea, and extinct taxa also in Antarctica."@en)
