# Class: obo:FOODON_03414632 (shipworm)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414632 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414632 "The shipworms are marine bivalve molluscs in the family *Teredinidae*: a group of saltwater clams with long, soft, naked bodies. They are notorious for boring into (and commonly eventually destroying) wood that is immersed in sea water."@en)
