AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414689 "Hornstedtia is a genus of plants in the Zingiberaceae*. It is native to Southeast Asia, the Himalayas, southern China, New Guinea, Melanesia and Queensland. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hornstedtia]"@en)
