# Class: obo:FOODON_03414690 (native ginger plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414690 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414690 "Alpinia caerulea, native ginger, is an understorey perennial herb to 3 m, growing under rainforest, gallery forest and wet sclerophyll forest canopy in eastern Australia. Family: *Zingiberaceae*. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alpinia_caerulea]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03414690 <http://eol.org/pages/8183>)
