AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414741 "Ipomoea is the largest genus in the flowering plant family *Convolvulaceae*, with over 500 species. It is a large and diverse group with common names including morning glory, water convolvulus or kangkung, sweet potato, bindweed, moonflower, etc. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ipomoea]"@en)
