AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414742 "Vigna is a genus of flowering plants in the legume family, *Fabaceae*, with a pantropical distribution. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vigna]"@en)
