AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414745 "Chenopodium is a genus of numerous species of perennial or annual herbaceous flowering plants known as the goosefoots, which occur almost anywhere in the world. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chenopodium]"@en)
