AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414752 "Calostemma is a small genus of herbaceous, perennial and bulbous plants in the Amaryllis family (*Amaryllidaceae*, subfamily *Amaryllidoideae*), commonly known as Wilcannia Lily. It consists of three species endemic to Australia, where they are distributed in arid regions with summer precipitation. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Calostemma]"@en)
