AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414754 "Cartonema is a genus of perennial or annual monocotyledonous flowering plants in the dayflower family. It is restricted to Australia and nearby Trangan Island, which is part of Indonesia. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cartonema]"@en)
