AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414759 "Curculigo is a flowering plant genus in the family *Hypoxidaceae*, first described in 1788. It is widespread across tropical regions of Asia, Africa, Australia, and the Americas. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Curculigo]"@en)
