AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414764 "Dichapetalum is a genus in the plant family *Dichapetalaceae*. The plants are tropical lianas native to warmer regions of Africa, Asia, Malesia, the West Indies, Australia and Latin America.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dichapetalum]"@en)
