AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414766 "Emilia is a genus of herbaceous plants in the sunflower family, known as tasselflower or pualele. The members of the genus are distributed mainly in the tropics and sub-tropics of Africa and Asia. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emilia_(plant)]"@en)
