AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414776 "Melaleuca is a genus of nearly 300 species of plants in the myrtle family, *Myrtaceae*, commonly known as paperbarks, honey-myrtles or tea-trees (although the last name is also applied to species of Leptospermum). [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Melaleuca]"@en)
