AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414777 "Melodinus is a genus of plant in family *Apocynaceae*, first described as a genus in 1776. It is native to Southeast Asia, China, the Indian Subcontinent, Australia, and various islands in the western Pacific. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Melodinus]"@en)
