AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414789 "Stylobasium is a genus of xerophytic shrubs in the family *Surianaceae*. The genus is endemic to Australia, with species occurring in Western Australia, Northern Territory, and Queensland. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stylobasium]"@en)
