AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414790 "Terminalia is a genus of large trees of the flowering plant family *Combretaceae*, comprising around 100 species distributed in tropical regions of the world. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terminalia_(plant)]"@en)
