# Class: obo:FOODON_03414849 (equine animal)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414849 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414849 "Equus is a genus of mammals in the family Equidae, which includes horses, asses, and zebras. Within Equidae, Equus is the only recognized extant genus, comprising seven living species. The term equine refers to any member of this genus, including horses."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:FOODON_03414849 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Equus_(genus)>)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03414849 <http://eol.org/pages/1670>)
