AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414875 "A family of freshwater subtropical and tropical fish, belonging to the order Characiformes. Fish of this family are important as food and also include popular aquarium fish species [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Characidae]"@en)
