# Class: obo:FOODON_03414926 (maripa palm plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414926 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414926 "Attalea maripa, commonly called maripa palm, is a palm native to tropical South America and Trinidad and Tobago. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Attalea_maripa]"@en)
