AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03414991 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414991 "Rumex hydrolapathum, the great water dock, water dock, or giant water dock, is a species of perennial herbaceous plants in the genus *Rumex* native to fens and freshwater banks of Europe and Western Asia. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rumex_hydrolapathum]"@en)
