AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414995 "Santolina is a genus of plants in the chamomile tribe within the sunflower family, primarily from the western Mediterranean region. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Santolina]"@en)
