AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03414998 "Thymus citriodorus, the lemon thyme or citrus thyme, is a lemon-scented evergreen mat-forming perennial. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thymus_citriodorus]"@en)
