AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415041 "Curcuma zanthorrhiza, known as temulawak, Java ginger, Javanese ginger, or Javanese turmeric is a plant species, belonging to the ginger family. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Curcuma_zanthorrhiza]"@en)
