AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415052 "Saturn peaches, *Prunus persica* var. *platycarpa* (also known as donut (or doughnut) peaches), are a variety of peach with white flesh and a flattish, round shape."@en)
