AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415059 "Rubus coreanus, known as bokbunja, Korean black raspberry, or Korean bramble, is a species of raspberry native to Korea, Japan, and China. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rubus_coreanus]"@en)
