AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415097 "Firs (*Abies*) are a genus of 48-56 species of evergreen coniferous trees in the family Pinaceae. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fir]"@en)
