AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415106 "Amaranthus dubius, the red spinach, Chinese spinach, spleen amaranth, hon-toi-moi, yin choy, or hsien tsai is a plant species. It belongs to the economically important family *Amaranthaceae*. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amaranthus_dubius]"@en)
