AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415111 "Blumea is a genus of flowering plants belonging to the *Asteraceae* family. Many species of genus *Blumea* are used in traditional Chinese medicine. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blumea]"@en)
