# Class: obo:FOODON_03415116 (lemon savory plant)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03415116 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415116 "Satureja biflora, known as \"lemon savory\", grows widely in Southern and Eastern parts of Africa. The plant has been used in Kenyan and Tanzanian traditional medicine as an antimicrobial, spasmolytic, diuretic, analgesic, and cicatrizing herb.  [Moghdadam et al. (2015) Metabolite profiling for caffeic acid oligomers in *Satureja biflora*. Industrial Crops and Products, 76; 892-899]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03415116 langual:B5116)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03415116 "african lemon savory"@en)
