AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415123 "Swertia is a genus in the gentian family containing plants sometimes referred to as the felworts. Some species bear very showy purple and blue flowers. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Swertia]"@en)
