AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415125 "Lycopodium is a genus of clubmosses, also known as ground pines or creeping cedar, in the family *Lycopodiaceae*, a family of fern-allies - *Lycopodium* sp. herb has been used in the traditional Austrian medicine internally as tea or externally as compresses [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lycopodium]"@en)
