AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03415165 "Krameria is the only genus in the *Krameriaceae* family, of which any of the approximately 18 species are commonly known as rhatany, ratany or rattany. Rhatany is also the name given to krameria root, a botanical remedy consisting of the dried root of para rhatany (*Krameria argentea*) or Peruvian rhatany (*Krameria lappacea*). [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Krameria]"@en)
