# Class: obo:FOODON_03420116 (organism material)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03420116 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03420116 "Material which is distinguished primarily by the organism(s) it derives from."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000116 obo:FOODON_03420116 "This was renamed from \"part of organism\" (and from LanguaL's original \"part of plant or animal\") to encompass organism material that is produced by an animal or plant rather than \"part of\" it, such as an egg, and might not be countable per se, such as milk. Additionally the existing definition's \"from which a food product or its major ingredient is derived.\" was removed as an unnecessary constraint. [2023/03/02]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03420116 langual:B0001)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03420116 langual:B1564)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03420116 langual:C0116)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03420116 "LanguaL curation note: \"e.g. *LEAF*, *ROOT OR TUBER*, *ORGAN MEAT*, *MILK* OR *EGG*; it also includes components of parts, such as *CREAM*, and extracts, concentrates or isolates, such as *PROTEIN EXTRACT* or *SUGAR*.\""@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03420116 "Old definition as of Feb 25, 2025: Anatomical or other part(s) or substances derived from plant or animal or fungal organisms."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03420116 "organism material"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03420116 obo:FOODON_00002403)

