AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03420127 "This is from a LanguaL \"ANIMAL BODY OR BODY PART\" class. Its subclasses can be used if it is ambiguous what animal is being referred to, and whether the reference is being made to a whole animal or some part of it, including parts of organs.  However, see if a more precise term is available under either the \"animal carcass\" branch or the \"piece of animal\" branch.

LanguaL curation note: Includes carcass meat, organ meat, and nonmeat parts of animals, as well as the whole animal."@en)
