AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03420167 "The fleshy fruit of any plant. *FRUIT* includes vegetables berries and pods as well. The bulk of a fruit is its fleshy part, which is covered by a peel (skin) and which encloses a core, pit or seeds."@en)
