# Class: obo:FOODON_03430122 (divided or disintegrated)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03430122 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03430122 langual:E0122)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03430122 "LanguaL curation note: The distinctions in this category are based on size characteristics, primarily thickness, which are important for heat transfer and for diffusion of chemicals in processing. *DIVIDED INTO HALVES, QUARTERS OR SEGMENTS* should be examined first and if one of the descriptors listed applies it should be used regardless of the size of the pieces. If none of these are applicable, other *DIVIDED OR DISINTEGRATED* descriptors should be examined. Do not use any of these descriptors if dividing or disintegrating results in a semiliquid or semisolid product."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03430122 "divided or disintegrated"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03430122 obo:FOODON_03430113)

