DisjointClasses(obo:FOODON_03510021 obo:FOODON_03510026)

# Class: obo:FOODON_03510023 (dietary claim)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510023 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510023 "Renamed from *FOOD FOR SPECIAL DIETARY USE* [LanguaL 2008].

These descriptors are used either for foods intended for special dietary use as defined in 21 CFR 105 or for foods that have special characteristics indicated in the name or labeling. Such claims would include 'low calorie', 'low cholesterol', 'diet' or 'dietetic', etc. Prior to february 1992, this category of descriptors was limited solely to food for adult humans. The category is now used in conjunction with any appropriate *CONSUMER GROUP* descriptor(s), for example, 'low sugar baby food' would be indexed by *INFANT OR TODDLER FOOD* as well as by *LOW SUGARS FOOD*."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510023 langual:P0023)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510023 langual:P0032)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510023 "dietary food"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510023 "dietary use"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510023 "food for dietary use"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510023 "food for special dietary use"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510023 "special dietary food"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510023 "dietary claim"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510023 obo:FOODON_03602001)

