LanguaL curation note: Renamed from *HIGH CALORIE FOOD* [LanguaL 2008]."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510060 "high energy food claim"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510060 obo:FOODON_03510045)

