AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510224 langual:P0224)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03510224 "Regulated by Directive 2003/89/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council of 10 November 2003 amending Directive 2000/13/EC as regards indication of the ingredients present in foodstuffs."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510224 "food allergen labelling about sesame seeds and products thereof"@en)
