AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510264 "In the United States, these claims, usually referred to as \"qualified health claims\", are regulated by the Food and Drug Administration in the public interest, see 21 Code of Federal Regulations § 101.14 [http://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cdrh/cfdocs/cfcfr/CFRSearch.cfm?fr=101.14]"@en)
