# Class: obo:FOODON_03510265 (structure/function claim)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03510265 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03510265 "Structure/function claims describe the role of a nutrient or dietary ingredient intended to affect normal structure or function in humans, for example, \"calcium builds strong bones\". In addition, they may characterize the means by which a nutrient or dietary ingredient acts to maintain such structure or function, for example, \"fiber maintains bowel regularity,\" or \"antioxidants maintain cell integrity,\" or they may describe general well-being from consumption of a nutrient or dietary ingredient. [http://www.fda.gov/Food/LabelingNutrition/LabelClaims/StructureFunctionClaims/default.htm]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:FOODON_03510265 langual:P0265)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510265 "article 13 health claims (european commission)"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasSynonym obo:FOODON_03510265 "nutrient function claim (codex alimentarius)"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03510265 "structure/function claim"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_03510265 obo:FOODON_03510124)

