# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_106559 (Malus mandshurica)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_106559 obo:IAO_0000122)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_106559 "Manchurian crabapple plant (Malus baccata) is an Asian species of apple native to much of northern Asia, but is also grown elsewhere as an ornamental tree and for rootstock. It is used for bonsai. It bears plentiful fragrant white flowers and edible red to yellow fruit of about 1 cm diameter."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:NCBITaxon_106559 "manchurian crabapple plant"@en)
