AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_1137871 "*Herniaria hirsuta* is a species of flowering plant in the pink family known by the common name hairy rupturewort. This plant is used in Morocco as an herbal remedy for kidney stones. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Herniaria_hirsuta]"@en)
