# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_115624 (Herniaria glabra)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_115624 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_115624 "*Herniaria glabra*, known as smooth rupturewort, is a plant of the family *Caryophyllaceae*. Growing in North America and Europe. It contains herniarin, a methoxy analog of umbelliferone. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Herniaria_glabra]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:NCBITaxon_115624 "smooth rupturewort plant"@en)
