# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_119488 (Siniperca chuatsi)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_119488 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_119488 "A species of temperate perch native to the Amur and Yangtze basins, and other rivers and lakes in China. The mandarin fish is a commercially important species, as it is a popular food fish and has been widely farmed in its native range since the 20th century."@en)
