AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_122118 "*Prunus americana*, commonly called the American plum, wild plum, or Marshall's large yellow sweet plum, is a species of *Prunus* native to North America from Saskatchewan to New Mexico east to New Hampshire and Florida."@en)
