# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_140311 (Prunus cerasus)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_140311 obo:IAO_0000122)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_140311 "*Prunus cerasus* (sour cherry, tart cherry, or dwarf cherry) is a species of *Prunus* in the subgenus *Cerasus* (cherries), native to much of Europe and southwest Asia."@en)
