AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_145754 "*Malva sylvestris* is a species of the mallow genus *Malva* in the family of *Malvaceae* and is considered to be the type species for the genus. Known as common mallow to English-speaking Europeans, it acquired the common names of cheeses, high mallow and tall mallow (mauve des bois by the French). [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Malva_sylvestris]"@en)
