# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_181181 (Buglossoides arvensis)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_181181 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_181181 "*Lithospermum arvense*, the field gromwell, corn gromwell, or bastard alkanet, is a flowering plant of the family *Boraginaceae*. It is also known as *Buglossoides arvensis*. The European Union has granted the refined oil of the seed of *Buglossoides arvensis* novel food status and some farmers are growing it. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lithospermum_arvense]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:NCBITaxon_181181 "corn gromwell plant"@en)
