# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_181185 (Cordia myxa)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_181185 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_181185 "*Cordia myxa* is a species of flowering plant in the borage family, Boraginaceae. It is a medium-sized broad-leaved deciduous tree. Common names include Assyrian plum, lasura, pidar, panugeri, naruvilli, geduri, spistan, burgund dulu wanan and ntege.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cordia_myxa]"@en)
