AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_194251 "Breadfruit (Artocarpus altilis) is a species of flowering tree in the mulberry and jackfruit family (Moraceae) originating in the South Pacific and eventually spreading to the rest of Oceania."@en)
