AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_205524 "*Solanum aethiopicum*, the bitter tomato, Ethiopian eggplant, or nakati, is a fruiting plant of the genus *Solanum* mainly found in Asia and Tropical Africa. It is also known as Ethiopian nightshade, garden eggs, and mock tomato. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solanum_aethiopicum]"@en)
