AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_267067 "*Enteroctopus dofleini*, also known as the giant Pacific octopus or North Pacific giant octopus, is a large cephalopod belonging to the genus *Enteroctopus*."@en)
