# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_29159 (Magallana gigas)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_29159 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_29159 "The Pacific oyster, Japanese oyster, or Miyagi oyster (*Magallana gigas*) (previously *Crassostrea gigas*), is an oyster native to the Pacific coast of Asia. It has become an introduced species in North America, Australia, Europe, and New Zealand. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pacific_oyster]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:NCBITaxon_29159 "pacific giant oyster"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:NCBITaxon_29159 <http://eol.org/pages/451579>)
