# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_29960 (Penaeus indicus)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_29960 "The Indian prawn (Fenneropenaeus indicus, formerly Penaeus indicus), is one of the major commercial prawn species of the world. It is found in the Indo-West Pacific from eastern and south-eastern Africa, through India, Malaysia and Indonesia to southern China and northern Australia")
