AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_304130 "The tomatillo (*Physalis philadelphica*), also known as the Mexican husk tomato, is a plant of the nightshade family bearing small, spherical and green or green-purple fruit of the same name."@en)
