AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_320667 "*Trichosanthes dioica*, also known as pointed gourd, is a vine plant in the *Cucurbitaceae* family, similar to cucumber and squash, though unlike those it is perennial. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trichosanthes_dioica]"@en)
