AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_3277 "*Matteuccia* is a genus of ferns with one species, *Matteuccia struthiopteris* (common names ostrich fern, fiddlehead fern or shuttlecock fern). [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Matteuccia]"@en)
