AnnotationAssertion(go:hasNarrowSynonym obo:NCBITaxon_34199 "Aloe vera (L.) Burm. f.")
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasNarrowSynonym obo:NCBITaxon_34199 "Aloë vera (L.) Burm. fil.")
