# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_34256 (Mentha x piperita)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_34256 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_34256 "Peppermint (*Mentha × piperita*, also known as *Mentha balsamea* Wild.) is a hybrid mint, a cross between watermint and spearmint. Indigenous to Europe and the Middle East, the plant is now widely spread and cultivated in many regions of the world. It is occasionally found in the wild with its parent species. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peppermint]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:NCBITaxon_34256 "peppermint plant"@en)
