# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_3567 (Amaranthus caudatus)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_3567 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_3567 "*Amaranthus caudatus* is a species of annual flowering plant. It goes by common names such as love-lies-bleeding, pendant amaranth, tassel flower, velvet flower, foxtail amaranth, and quilete. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amaranthus_caudatus]"@en)
