# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_3621 (Rheum rhabarbarum)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_3621 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_3621 "Rhubarb (*Rheum rhabarbarum*) is a species of plant in the family *Polygonaceae*. In culinary use, fresh raw leaf stalks (petioles) are crisp (similar to celery, although they do not share the same family) with a strong, tart taste. Although rhubarb is not a true fruit, in the kitchen it is usually prepared as if it were. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rhubarb]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:NCBITaxon_3621 "garden rhubarb plant"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:NCBITaxon_3621 <http://eol.org/pages/485576>)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:NCBITaxon_3621 <http://www.ars-grin.gov/cgi-bin/npgs/html/taxon.pl?311395>)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:NCBITaxon_3621 <http://www.itis.gov/servlet/SingleRpt/SingleRpt?search_topic=TSN&search_value=504747>)
