# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_36622 (Chaenomeles sinensis)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_36622 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_36622 "*Pseudocydonia sinensis*, the Chinese quince, is a deciduous or semi-evergreen tree in the family *Rosaceae*, native to eastern Asia in China, and the sole species in the genus *Pseudocydonia*. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pseudocydonia]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:NCBITaxon_36622 "chinese quince plant"@en)
