# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_37334 (Citrus maxima)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_37334 "The pomelo,* Citrus maxima*, or* Citrus grandis*, is a natural (non-hybrid) citrus fruit, similar in appearance to a large grapefruit, native to South and Southeast Asia."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:NCBITaxon_37334 <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-8844-9165>)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:NCBITaxon_37334 wikipedia:Pomelo)
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:date obo:NCBITaxon_37334 "2022-02-20T06:09:55Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:NCBITaxon_37334 <http://eol.org/pages/488254>)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:NCBITaxon_37334 <http://www.ars-grin.gov/cgi-bin/npgs/html/taxon.pl?10744>)
