AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_3821 "The pigeon pea (Cajanus cajan) is a perennial legume from the family Fabaceae. Since its domestication in the Indian subcontinent at least 3,500 years ago, its seeds have become a common food in Asia, Africa, and Latin America."@en)
