# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_3823 (Canavalia ensiformis)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_3823 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_3823 "*Canavalia ensiformis*, or (common) jack bean, is a legume which is used for animal fodder and human nutrition, especially in Brazil where it is called feijão-de-porco (\"pig bean\"). It is also the source of concanavalin A.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canavalia_ensiformis]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:NCBITaxon_3823 "jack-bean plant"@en)
