# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_3847 (Glycine max)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_3847 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_3847 "The soybean or soya bean (Glycine max) is a species of legume native to East Asia, widely grown for its edible bean, which has numerous uses.  Traditional unfermented food uses of soybeans include soy milk, from  which tofu and tofu skin are made. Fermented soy foods include soy sauce, fermented bean paste, nattō, and tempeh."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:NCBITaxon_3847 "soybean plant"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:NCBITaxon_3847 "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soybean"^^xsd:anyURI)
