# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_3914 (Vigna angularis)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_3914 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_3914 "The adzuki bean (*Vigna angularis* (English: red mung bean) is an annual vine widely grown throughout East Asia and the Himalayas for its small (approximately 5 mm) bean. The cultivars most familiar in Northeast Asia have a uniform red colour, however, white, black, gray, and variously mottled varieties also are known.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adzuki_bean]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:NCBITaxon_3914 "adzuki bean plant"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:NCBITaxon_3914 <http://eol.org/pages/4277>)
