AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_4220 "*Artemisia vulgaris* (common mugwort or common wormwood) is one of several species in the genus *Artemisia* commonly known as mugwort, although Artemisia vulgaris is the species most often called mugwort. Mugworts have been used medicinally and as culinary herbs. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artemisia_vulgaris]"@en)
