AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_42529 "A large species of pacu, a close relative of piranhas and silver dollars, in the serrasalmid family. It is native to the Amazon and Orinoco basins in tropical South America, but it is widely farmed and has been introduced to other regions."@en)
