AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_4682 "Garlic (*Allium sativum*) is a species in the onion genus, *Allium*.Its close relatives include the onion, shallot, leek, chive, and Chinese onion. Garlic is native to Central Asia and northeastern Iran, and has long been a common seasoning worldwide, with a history of several thousand years of human consumption and use. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Garlic]"@en)
