# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_48042 (Levisticum officinale)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_48042 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_48042 "Lovage, *Levisticum officinale*, is a tall perennial plant, the sole species in the genus Levisticum in the family *Apiaceae*, subfamily *Apioideae*. The leaves can be used in salads, or to make soup or season broths, and the roots can be eaten as a vegetable or grated for use in salads. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lovage]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:NCBITaxon_48042 "lovage plant"@en)
