AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_480971 "*Caryocar brasiliense*, known as Pequi or \"souari nut\", like its congeners, is an edible fruit popular in some areas of Brazil, especially in Brazil's center-west region."@en)
