# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_49825 (Genista tinctoria)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_49825 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_49825 "*Genista tinctoria* (dyer's greenweed or dyer's broom) is a species of flowering plant of the family *Fabaceae*. The plant has been used in popular medicine and herbalism for various complaints, including skin diseases, even in modern times. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Genista_tinctoria]"@en)
