# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_50174 (Ximenia americana)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_50174 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_50174 "*Ximenia americana*, commonly known as tallow wood, yellow plum or sea lemon, is a small sprawling tree of woodlands native to the tropics. The fruits have a pleasant plum-like flavor. In Asia, the young leaves are cooked as a vegetable. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ximenia_americana]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:NCBITaxon_50174 "tallow wood"@en)
