# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_56993 (Araucaria bidwillii)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_56993 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_56993 "*Araucaria bidwillii*, the bunya pine, is a large evergreen coniferous tree in the plant family *Araucariaceae*. It is found naturally in south-east Queensland Australia and two small disjunct populations in north eastern Queensland's World Heritage listed Wet Tropics.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Araucaria_bidwillii]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:NCBITaxon_56993 "bunya pine tree"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:NCBITaxon_56993 <http://eol.org/pages/323342>)
