# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_58039 (Juniperus communis)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_58039 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_58039 "*Juniperus communis*, the common juniper, is a species of conifer in the genus *Juniperus*, in the family *Cupressaceae*. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juniperus_communis]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:NCBITaxon_58039 "juniper plant"@en)
