AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_62752 "*Pinus sibirica*, or Siberian pine, in the family Pinaceae is a species of pine tree that occurs in Siberia. The seeds are also harvested and sold as pine nuts, which in Russia are marketed as Cedar nuts. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinus_sibirica]"@en)
