# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_64152 (Channa striata)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_64152 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_64152 "*Channa striata*, the striped snakehead, is a species of snakehead fish. It is also known as the common snakehead, chevron snakehead and snakehead murrel. It is native to South and Southeast Asia, and has been introduced to some Pacific Islands. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Channa_striata]"@en)
