AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_75352 "A species of cyprinid fish native to the Yangtze basin, China, including Liangzi Lake. It is an important object of fish farming, and in 2012 its total production ranked 12th on the world list of most important fish species in aquaculture."@en)
