# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_75356 (Mylopharyngodon piceus)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_75356 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_75356 "A species of cyprinid fish and the sole species of the genus *Mylopharyngodon*. It is native to lakes and rivers in East Asia, ranging from the Amur Basin, through China, to Vietnam. In China, black carp are the most highly esteemed and expensive foodfish among the four domestic fishes."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:NCBITaxon_75356 "black carp"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:NCBITaxon_75356 wikipedia:Black_carp)
