# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_79629 (Fulmarus glacialoides)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_79629 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_79629 "The southern fulmar (*Fulmarus glacialoides*) is a seabird of the Southern Hemisphere. Along with the northern fulmar, *Fulmarus glacialis*, it belongs to the fulmar genus *Fulmarus* in the family *Procellariidae*, the true petrels. It is also known as the Antarctic fulmar or silver-grey fulmar."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:NCBITaxon_79629 "southern fulmar"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:NCBITaxon_79629 "WIKIPEDIA:Southern_fulmar")
