AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_87088 "*Vigna umbellata* (Thunb.) Ohwi and Ohashi, previously *Phaseolus calcaratus*, is a warm-season annual vine legume with yellow flowers and small edible beans. It is commonly called ricebean or rice bean."@en)
