AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_97750 "*Kaempferia galanga*, commonly known as kencur, aromatic ginger, sand ginger, cutcherry, or resurrection lily, is a monocotyledonous plant in the ginger family, and one of four plants called galangal.  [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaempferia_galanga]"@en)
