AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_984867 "*Consolida regalis*, with the common names forking larkspur, rocket-larkspur, and field larkspur, is an annual herbaceous plant belonging to the genus *Consolida* of the buttercup family (*Ranunculaceae*). 
