# Class: obo:NCBITaxon_99038 (Glebionis coronaria)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:NCBITaxon_99038 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_99038 "*Glebionis coronaria*, formerly called *Chrysanthemum coronarium*, is a species of flowering plant in the daisy family. *Glebionis coronaria* is used as a leaf vegetable. English language common names include garland chrysanthemum, chrysanthemum greens, edible chrysanthemum, crowndaisy chrysanthemum, chop suey green, crown daisy, and Japanese-green. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Glebionis_coronaria]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:NCBITaxon_99038 "garland chrysanthemum plant"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:NCBITaxon_99038 <http://eol.org/pages/469139>)
