AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03414170 "A species of fungus of genus Tremella; it produces white, frond-like, gelatinous basidiocarps (fruiting bodies). It is widespread, especially in the tropics, where it can be found on the dead branches of broadleaf trees. This fungus is commercially cultivated and is one of the most popular fungi in the cuisine and medicine of China."@en)
