AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_307728 "*Opuntia polyacantha* is a common species of cactus known by the common names plains pricklypear, hairspine cactus, panhandle pricklypear, and starvation pricklypear. It is native to North America, where it is widespread in western Canada, the central and western United States, and northern Mexico."@en)
