AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCBITaxon_5204 "*Basidiomycota* is one of two large phyla that, together with the *Ascomycota*, constitute the subkingdom *Dikarya* (often referred to as the \"higher fungi\") within the kingdom Fungi. More specifically the *Basidiomycota* include these groups: mushrooms, puffballs, stinkhorns, bracket fungi, other polypores, jelly fungi, boletes, chanterelles, earth stars, smuts, bunts, rusts, mirror yeasts, and the human pathogenic yeast *Cryptococcus*."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:NCBITaxon_5204 "WIKIPEDIA:Basidiomycota")
AnnotationAssertion(go:hasDbXref obo:NCBITaxon_5204 <http://eol.org/pages/5664>)
